{"after_excerpt":{"locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:db49ea971dd06c998a4e8b108a6dff43cb5a4b3e91384c7654d1363842286522","joiner":"","kind":"TEXT_SPANS","output_sha256":"999effc20a431c68d28b9378eee31ce492e9a57e9b985f25ff2a7388adf9c11c","raw_text_sha256":"9ba7cd55b8d09ee9c5507205bd23683145444b01730efb66eeef2e63fee60809","schema_version":2,"spans":[{"end":955,"start":909,"unit_ref":"text:1"}]},"text":"至曹頫家屬蒙恩諭少留房產以資養贍今其家屬不久回京奴才應將在京房屋人口酌量撥給以彰聖主覆載之恩","text_sha256":"9ba7cd55b8d09ee9c5507205bd23683145444b01730efb66eeef2e63fee60809"},"before_sha256":"edd46baf5e7e8e3823ff61ba2a94fca25fc72f9ff845d37d69e7a609e87af114","before_source":{"bibliography":{"citation":"《曹家档案史料》二百八十六","url":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=962820&if=gb&remap=gb"},"container":{"ref":"asset:sha256:ed674f0c11e4debd80da22f139d8e1c15c902cc59e35c8e6d51e0ff00e94860a","sha256":"ed674f0c11e4debd80da22f139d8e1c15c902cc59e35c8e6d51e0ff00e94860a"},"id":"src:history:cao:1728:family-housing","locator":{"date":"雍正六年三月初二日","document_no":286,"passage":"少留房产以资养赡"},"locator_verification":{"reason":"EXCERPT_NOT_FOUND","status":"UNVERIFIED"},"notes":"证明抄没后仍可能为家属保留/拨给有限居住资源；不是贾府具体住房证据。","text":"至曹頫家屬，蒙恩諭少留房產以資養贍，今其家屬不久回京，奴才應將在京房屋人口酌量撥給，以彰聖主覆載之恩。","text_sha256":"f922887865a1abc1de4fdd49b7d354242a22cc3e4142f187ff3885f63fa7fe6e","title":"雍正六年隋赫德奏折——曹家属少留房产养赡","type":"HISTORICAL_PRIMARY","witness":{"annotation":"雍正六年三月初二日","label":"江宁织造隋赫德奏细查曹頫房地产及家人情形摺","siglum":"CAO-ARCHIVE-286"}},"claim_reviews":[{"claim_id":"claim:history:h04:post-confiscation-housing","claim_sha256":"bcffdc1fce1885bbe620a30e523dc7e4ae840e898b3cfb24bf06e3af48e900a4","rationale":"原件明确少留房產以資養贍、在京房屋人口酌量撥給；撤去后加标点不改变抄没后家属安置的历史可能，仍不指认小说人物的住所。","result":"RETAIN_EXISTING_ASSERTION"}],"impact":{"claims":[{"authority_scope":"HISTORICAL_FEASIBILITY","id":"claim:history:h04:post-confiscation-housing","kind":"HISTORICAL_MECHANISM","modality":"DIRECT_ASSERTION","statement":"曹家实案显示抄没后仍可能为家属少留或酌拨有限房产以资养赡。","status":"SUPPORTED","support":[{"relation":"DIRECT","source":"src:history:cao:1728:family-housing"}]}],"decisions":[],"implementations":[],"title_axes":[]},"impact_sha256":"b41b868015e58608fd647aea4cc1070bb64d07013ad481de2f6a59a2673cbf3f","kind":"SOURCE_EXCERPT_CORRECTION","limitations":["AGENT_TEXT_REVIEW：校录由Codex目读故宫005664图像完成，非馆方录文或OCR；独立人工复核仍待提交。","Locator v2验证本地代理校录的精确重取；原图字节与图像位置另在校勘记录及verify_cao_facsimile.py验证，机械检查不独立确认手写字的识读。","原导入书目和286编号保留用于追溯，不确认旧130页候选录本出版版次；两个官方刊图只是一份原件。"],"omitted_line_breaks":[],"operation":"REPLACE_EXCERPT","rationale":"原件确为“少留房產”，不能因论文节引“房屋”而替换。原引文的汉字与原件吻合；仅撤去后加标点并接续抬头、分列，保留“以彰聖主覆載之恩”。 原件逐列依据：asset:sha256:c5e8e3f7cfc21a7a2d2398c70ac7e017a8cd8ee905a186e1e17f4fbcc29bb943","reviewer":{"kind":"AGENT_TEXT_REVIEW","name":"Codex"},"schema_version":1,"source_id":"src:history:cao:1728:family-housing"}
